{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $24k+36q-12$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $12$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24k+36q-12\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{24k+36q-12}{12}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{24k}{12}+\\dfrac{36q}{12}-\\dfrac{12}{12}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12(2k+3q-1)\n\\end{align}$\n\nWe see that $24k+36q-12$ is equivalent to $12(2k+3q-1)$, not to $12(2k+3q)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $3$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24k+36q-12\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{24k+36q-12}{3}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{24k}{3}+\\dfrac{36q}{3}-\\dfrac{12}{3}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3(8k+12q-4)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $24k+36q-12$ is equivalent to $3(8k+12q-4)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24k+36q-12\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{24k+36q-12}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{24k}{6}+\\dfrac{36q}{6}-\\dfrac{12}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(4k+6q-2)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $24k+36q-12$ is *not* equivalent to $6(3k+6q-12)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $24k+36q-12$:\n\n- $12(2k+3q-1)$\n- $3(8k+12q-4)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $24k+36q-12$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24k+36q-12$.","content":"$12(2k+3q-1)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24k+36q-12$.","content":"$3(8k+12q-4)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $18k+36q-72$.","content":"$6(3k+6q-12)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24k+36q$.","content":"$12(2k+3q)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
